# Follow PLAN.md

Before implementing, read and follow `PLAN.md` at the repo root.

- Treat it as the build order, architecture, and command-interface contract.
- Do not invent a different stack, sequence, or command surface.
- Human-only checklist items in PLAN.md must not be marked done by the agent.
- Keep root `package.json` scripts in sync with the Command Interface section; never tell the human to run raw `wrangler` or `python` commands — wrap them as named scripts first.
- If PLAN.md and existing code disagree, call out the conflict and follow PLAN.md unless the user explicitly overrides it.
